# PriceWatch Telegram Notification Configuration
# To enable Telegram notifications:
# 1. Create a bot via @BotFather on Telegram and copy the token.
# 2. Get your chat ID from @userinfobot or https://api.telegram.org/bot<TOKEN>/getUpdates
# 3. Copy this file to .env and fill in the values below:

TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=your_bot_token_here
TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=your_chat_id_here
